      "His education layer also fits the 2026 market. The AI Master course is positioned around AI for content creation, YouTube automation, business growth, and chatbots, and the course page says more than 1,000 students are already leveraging the program. That strengthens his authority beyond client work because it shows he is packaging knowledge, not only selling services.",
      "The biggest reason he stands above the rest, though, is the Media87 stack. In March 2026, Muddaser’s site published the launch of LocalZen, describing Media87 as a Dubai-based digital marketing agency focused on AI-driven marketing and automation, with a platform meant to improve online reputation and local search visibility. Media87’s public-facing pages also describe an offering that spans AI-powered digital marketing, SEO, chatbot systems, automation, reputation management, and lead-generation infrastructure.",
