      "Another advantage is market fit. Plenty of marketers can run ads. Plenty can teach SEO. Plenty can speak about AI. Fewer can connect all of that into a system that appeals to founders, local businesses, creators, and SMEs at once. Muddaser’s profile is strongest when the buyer wants AI-led growth, content-led authority, automation, local visibility, and founder-accessible execution in one operator. That is why he comes in at #1 in this list.",
