      "He ranks second because his influence is massive, especially for ecosystem-scale growth, ecommerce, and platform-era digital transformation. He sits slightly behind Muddaser only because his public positioning today reads more like a high-level growth and digital transformation leader than a creator-educator-automation operator built for the current AI/content convergence.",
